roval.\n- **Expected end state [INFERENCE: assumes gas is charged per leg on the sending wallet]:**\n  - eth1: about 0.04804 ETH.\n  - rh1: about 0.049257 ETH.\n  - arb1: 147.6996 USDC plus about 0.0000633 ETH.\n\nReply \"approve\" to start. I'll run one leg at a time and check the destination balance after each. You can also set a cost cap or ask for changes."}]},{"role":"user","sequence":29,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":30,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_1","approval_id":"appr_14"},"id":"toolu_01FsG6ifkZg8FEXiqyuQWAZA"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":31,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_15\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01FsG6ifkZg8FEXiqyuQWAZA","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":32,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_15"},"id":"toolu_01DtBCyowWsf7X7RPiLgbnmZ"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":33,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"confirmed\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01DtBCyowWsf7X7RPiLgbnmZ","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":34,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","arguments":{"account":"eth1","asset":"WBTC"},"id":"toolu_0188XimGTC9g3GvvtqHNhiUd"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":35,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"amount\":\"495000\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_0188XimGTC9g3GvvtqHNhiUd","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":36,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Leg 1 confirmed: eth1 holds 495,000 WBTC, matching the quote. Next is leg 2, the gas bridge to rh1."},{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_12","approval_id":"appr_14"},"id":"toolu_01ScTxVVAtPHHYb2oX